{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"## Task\n\n\nYour task is to respond correctly with strict JSON object containing extracted data within a ```json {} ``` codeblock. Object must validate against this JSONSchema:\n<|json_schema|>\n\n\n## Output Requirements\n\nRespond with a strict JSON object that matches this JSON Schema:\n\n{\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"x-title\": \"User\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"age\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\"\n        },\n        \"name\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\n        \"age\",\n        \"name\"\n    ],\n    \"x-php-class\": \"User\",\n    \"additionalProperties\": false\n}\n\nReturn the result inside a fenced `json` code block."},{"role":"user","content":"Our user Jason is 25 years old."}],"max_completion_tokens":1024}